<section class="section-block">
	<h2>Limits of this design</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Two built-in voices per language.</strong> The built-in voices offer one male and one female voice. More voices, or a particular one, need your own text-to-speech provider.</li>
		<li><strong>Only emphasis is honored.</strong> Inside <code>&lt;Say&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;emphasis&gt;</code> is the one tag that changes how text is spoken.</li>
		<li><strong>The clip must be reachable.</strong> If the audio URL can&rsquo;t be fetched, or serves something other than audio, the clip doesn&rsquo;t play.</li>
	</ul>
</section>

